#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base/models/hr_employee.py:0
msgid ""
"%(employee)s already taxes the month for %(linked)s, so it cannot be taxed "
"on another record. One record taxes the month for all the others."
msgstr ""
"Na karte %(employee)s sa už zdaňuje mesiac za %(linked)s, preto ju nemožno "
"zdaňovať na inej karte. Jedna karta zdaňuje mesiac za všetky ostatné."

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base/models/hr_employee.py:0
msgid ""
"%(employee)s and %(other)s have different birth numbers, so they are not one"
" taxpayer and cannot be taxed together."
msgstr ""
"%(employee)s a %(other)s majú rôzne rodné čísla, nie sú teda jeden daňovník "
"a nemožno ich zdaňovať spolu."

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base/models/hr_version.py:0
msgid ""
"%(employee)s and %(other)s have the same birth number, so they are one "
"taxpayer at this employer. The taxpayer's declaration can be signed on one "
"of them at a time (§ 36 ods. 6 zákona č. 595/2003 Z. z.), and it is ticked "
"on both for a day they share: from %(start)s on %(employee)s and from "
"%(other_start)s on %(other)s. Untick Tax Declaration Signed on one of the "
"two."
msgstr ""
"%(employee)s a %(other)s majú rovnaké rodné číslo, u tohto zamestnávateľa "
"sú teda jeden daňovník. Vyhlásenie na zdanenie príjmov môže byť naraz "
"podpísané len na jednej z kariet (§ 36 ods. 6 zákona č. 595/2003 Z. z.) a "
"je zaškrtnuté na oboch v deň, ktorý majú spoločný: od %(start)s na karte "
"%(employee)s a od %(other_start)s na karte %(other)s. Na jednej z nich "
"zrušte zaškrtnutie poľa Podpísané vyhlásenie na zdanenie príjmov."

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base/models/hr_employee.py:0
msgid ""
"%(employee)s can be taxed together only with a record of the same company: "
"the tax of the month is the tax of what one employer pays."
msgstr ""
"%(employee)s možno zdaňovať len spolu s kartou tej istej spoločnosti: daň "
"za mesiac je daň z toho, čo vypláca jeden zamestnávateľ."

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base/models/hr_employee.py:0
msgid "%(employee)s cannot be taxed together with itself."
msgstr "%(employee)s nemožno zdaňovať spolu so sebou samou."

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base.field_hr_version__display_name
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base.field_l10n_sk_payslip_fund_mixin__display_name
msgid "Display Name"
msgstr "Zobrazovaný názov"

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#: model:ir.model,name:l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base.model_hr_employee
msgid "Employee"
msgstr "Zamestnanec"

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#: model:ir.model,name:l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base.model_hr_version
msgid "Employee Contract / Version"
msgstr "Zmluva / verzia zamestnanca"

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base/models/payslip_fund_mixin.py:0
msgid "Fund evidence is generated by payroll calculation."
msgstr "Podklady fondov vytvára výpočet mzdy."

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base.field_hr_version__id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base.field_l10n_sk_payslip_fund_mixin__id
msgid "ID"
msgstr "ID"

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base/models/payslip_fund_mixin.py:0
msgid "Recalculate the unconfirmed payslip to record its payroll fund bases."
msgstr ""
"Prepočítajte nepotvrdenú výplatnú pásku, aby sa zaznamenali vymeriavacie "
"základy jej fondov."

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#: model:ir.model,name:l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base.model_l10n_sk_payslip_fund_mixin
msgid "Recorded payroll fund evidence"
msgstr "Zaznamenané podklady mzdových fondov"

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#: model:ir.model,name:l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base.model_l10n_sk_payslip_joint_tax_mixin
msgid "Slovak payslip: several records of one person taxed together"
msgstr "Slovenská výplatná páska: viac kariet jednej osoby zdaňovaných spolu"

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base.field_hr_employee__l10n_sk_tax_principal_id
msgid "Taxed Together With"
msgstr "Zdaňované spolu s"

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base/models/hr_employee.py:0
msgid ""
"Taxed Together With of %(employee)s cannot be changed now. The payslip "
"%(payslip)s moved its tax base to the payslip of %(principal)s, and of the "
"two payslips of that month one is confirmed and the other is not. Confirm "
"both, or refund the confirmed one, and change the link then."
msgstr ""
"Pole Zdaňované spolu s na karte %(employee)s teraz nemožno zmeniť. Výplatná "
"páska %(payslip)s presunula svoj základ dane na výplatnú pásku karty "
"%(principal)s a z dvoch výplatných pások toho mesiaca je jedna potvrdená a "
"druhá nie. Potvrďte obe alebo potvrdenú dobropisujte a prepojenie zmeňte až "
"potom."

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base/models/payslip_joint_tax_mixin.py:0
msgid ""
"Taxed Together With of %(employee)s, or the contract of the record named "
"there, changed after this payslip was computed. Compute the payslip again "
"before confirming it."
msgstr ""
"Pole Zdaňované spolu s na karte %(employee)s alebo zmluva karty, ktorá je v "
"ňom uvedená, sa zmenili po výpočte tejto výplatnej pásky. Pred potvrdením "
"ju vypočítajte znova."

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base.field_hr_employee__l10n_sk_tax_linked_ids
msgid "Taxed on This Record"
msgstr "Zdaňované na tejto karte"

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base.field_hr_employee__l10n_sk_tax_linked_ids
msgid ""
"The employee records of the same person whose tax base is taxed on the "
"payslip of this record."
msgstr ""
"Karty zamestnanca tej istej osoby, ktorých základ dane sa zdaňuje na "
"výplatnej páske tejto karty."

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base/models/payslip_joint_tax_mixin.py:0
msgid ""
"The income tax of %(employee)s is computed together with %(linked)s (Taxed "
"Together With). The payslip %(payslip)s of %(linked)s for this month is not "
"computed yet, or was computed before the two records were linked. Compute it"
" first."
msgstr ""
"Daň z príjmov karty %(employee)s sa počíta spolu s kartou %(linked)s "
"(Zdaňované spolu s). Výplatná páska %(payslip)s karty %(linked)s za tento "
"mesiac ešte nie je vypočítaná alebo bola vypočítaná pred prepojením oboch "
"kariet. Najprv ju vypočítajte."

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base/models/payslip_joint_tax_mixin.py:0
msgid ""
"The payslip %(payslip)s of %(principal)s for this month is confirmed, and "
"its income tax includes a tax base of %(took).2f taken over from the records"
" taxed together with it. With this payslip of %(employee)s that base would "
"be %(now).2f. Refund or cancel the payslip of %(principal)s first, then "
"compute this payslip and a new one for %(principal)s."
msgstr ""
"Výplatná páska %(payslip)s karty %(principal)s za tento mesiac je potvrdená "
"a jej daň z príjmov zahŕňa základ dane %(took).2f prevzatý z kariet "
"zdaňovaných spolu s ňou. S touto výplatnou páskou karty %(employee)s by "
"tento základ bol %(now).2f. Najprv dobropisujte alebo zrušte výplatnú pásku "
"karty %(principal)s, potom vypočítajte túto výplatnú pásku a novú pre kartu "
"%(principal)s."

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base/models/payslip_joint_tax_mixin.py:0
msgid ""
"The payslip of %(employee)s was computed with a tax base of %(took).2f taken"
" over from %(linked)s, and their payslips of this month now hold %(now).2f. "
"Compute the payslip of %(employee)s again before confirming it."
msgstr ""
"Výplatná páska karty %(employee)s bola vypočítaná so základom dane "
"%(took).2f prevzatým z kariet %(linked)s a ich výplatné pásky za tento "
"mesiac teraz obsahujú %(now).2f. Pred potvrdením vypočítajte výplatnú pásku "
"karty %(employee)s znova."

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base/models/payslip_fund_mixin.py:0
msgid "The recorded payroll fund bases are invalid."
msgstr "Zaznamenané vymeriavacie základy mzdových fondov sú neplatné."

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base/models/payslip_fund_mixin.py:0
msgid "The recorded payroll fund bases no longer match the payslip."
msgstr ""
"Zaznamenané vymeriavacie základy mzdových fondov už nezodpovedajú výplatnej "
"páske."

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base/models/payslip_joint_tax_mixin.py:0
msgid ""
"The tax base of this payslip of %(employee)s is taxed on the confirmed "
"payslip %(payslip)s of %(principal)s. Refund or cancel that payslip first."
msgstr ""
"Základ dane tejto výplatnej pásky karty %(employee)s je zdanený na "
"potvrdenej výplatnej páske %(payslip)s karty %(principal)s. Najprv ju "
"dobropisujte alebo zrušte."

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base/models/payslip_joint_tax_mixin.py:0
msgid ""
"The wage garnishment of %(employee)s cannot be computed on this payslip. Its"
" income tax is computed together with %(other)s, and a garnishment is "
"deducted from the person's whole net wage from the employer (§ 69 Exekučného"
" poriadku), which one payslip does not hold. Remove Taxed Together With to "
"tax the records separately, or leave the garnishment out of this payslip and"
" deduct it by hand."
msgstr ""
"Zrážku zo mzdy karty %(employee)s nemožno na tejto výplatnej páske "
"vypočítať. Jej daň z príjmov sa počíta spolu s kartou %(other)s a zrážky sa "
"vykonávajú z celej čistej mzdy osoby od zamestnávateľa (§ 69 Exekučného "
"poriadku), ktorú jedna výplatná páska neobsahuje. Zrušte pole Zdaňované "
"spolu s, aby sa karty zdaňovali samostatne, alebo zrážku na tejto výplatnej "
"páske vynechajte a vykonajte ju ručne."

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#: model:ir.model,name:l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base.model_hr_version
msgid "Employee Contract"
msgstr "Pracovná zmluva zamestnanca"

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base/models/payslip_fund_mixin.py:0
msgid ""
"%(employee)s: no sick pay is computed for the incapacity from %(onsets)s, "
"because its daily assessment base cannot be determined from the confirmed "
"payslips. Enter the base as the payslip input PN_DVZ."
msgstr ""
"%(employee)s: náhrada príjmu za pracovnú neschopnosť od %(onsets)s sa "
"nevypočíta, lebo jej denný vymeriavací základ sa nedá určiť z potvrdených "
"výplatných pások. Zadajte základ ako vstup výplatnej pásky PN_DVZ."

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base/models/hr_employee.py:0
msgid ""
"%(linked)s is taxed together with %(employee)s, so the two records have to "
"stay in one company."
msgstr ""
"%(linked)s sa zdaňuje spolu s kartou %(employee)s, preto musia obe karty "
"zostať v jednej spoločnosti."

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base/models/hr_employee.py:0
msgid ""
"%(principal)s is itself taxed together with %(other)s. Choose %(other)s for "
"%(employee)s as well: one record taxes the month for all the others."
msgstr ""
"%(principal)s sa sama zdaňuje spolu s kartou %(other)s. Aj pre %(employee)s "
"vyberte %(other)s: jedna karta zdaňuje mesiac za všetky ostatné."

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_hr_payroll_base.field_hr_employee__l10n_sk_tax_principal_id
msgid ""
"Another employee record of the same person in this company, for example the "
"employment beside this agreement. The income tax of this record is then "
"computed on the payslip of that record: it taxes the total of the month with"
" one non-taxable amount and one child tax bonus (§ 35 ods. 1 zákona č. "
"595/2003 Z. z.), and the payslip of this record shows its tax base and no "
"tax. Compute the payslip of this record first. Leave empty to tax this "
"record on its own."
msgstr ""
"Iná karta zamestnanca tej istej osoby v tejto spoločnosti, napríklad "
"pracovný pomer popri tejto dohode. Daň z príjmov tejto karty sa potom "
"počíta na výplatnej páske tamtej karty: zdaní úhrn za mesiac s jednou "
"nezdaniteľnou časťou základu dane a jedným daňovým bonusom na dieťa (§ 35 "
"ods. 1 zákona č. 595/2003 Z. z.) a výplatná páska tejto karty ukáže svoj "
"základ dane a žiadnu daň. Výplatnú pásku tejto karty vypočítajte ako prvú. "
"Ak má byť karta zdaňovaná samostatne, pole nechajte prázdne."
